final Keyword
-------------

final keyword in java is used to restrict modification.
it can be used with 
1)variables
2)methods
3)classes.

1 ) final variable
a finaly variable cannot be changed once assigned or initialized. we must initialize it only once either at declaration or in constructor.

2 ) final method
a final method cannod overridden in the child class.
it can be inherited but not modified.

3 ) final class
a final class cannot be inherited or extended.
no other class can become its child class.


